	(text "A0 POWER/RADIO CAPTURE — fully wired sheets, not a complete station PCB.\nRoot net labels interconnect sheets. MCU, sensor rails, mast-bus interface and sensor sheets remain to be captured.\nRADIO_* and I2C_* are3.3V host interfaces; CHG_STAT1/2 are open-drain status. 3V3 powers the future host.\nBase target<=0.06Wh/day; optional SPS30 budget60s/hour, off otherwise. No TX during pod/fan startup.\nSee DESIGN.md and hardware/specs/power-radio.md for limits, calculations and release gates."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
